WEBVTT

00:01:58.785 --> 00:02:00.273
Hold up, hold up, hold up.

00:02:00.297 --> 00:02:01.686
EC: Y'all remember the video.

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:03.890
This is like a little payback or something

00:02:03.914 --> 00:02:06.413
for 50 million people
calling me the loser.

00:02:06.437 --> 00:02:07.795
NP: Hold up, hold up.

00:02:07.819 --> 00:02:10.978
But a lot of people out there don't
really know what beatboxing is,

00:02:11.002 --> 00:02:12.525
where it started from.

00:02:12.549 --> 00:02:13.700
EC: Right, right.

00:02:13.724 --> 00:02:14.917
NP: Where it came from.

00:02:14.941 --> 00:02:17.298
So why don't you give
them a little history --

00:02:17.322 --> 00:02:20.013
just a tickle -- a bit of history
of where it comes from.

00:02:20.037 --> 00:02:21.894
EC: Beatbox started here in New York.

00:02:21.918 --> 00:02:23.069
(Cheers)

00:02:23.093 --> 00:02:26.580
That's right, that's right.
New York, New York!

00:02:26.604 --> 00:02:28.231
Everybody like, "Yeah!"

00:02:28.255 --> 00:02:29.745
Well, we from St. Louis.

00:02:29.769 --> 00:02:30.787
(Laughter)